[32m✔ asset lineage is owner-scoped and cannot reveal another user current or descendants [90m(703.3685ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ legacy unmapped project-resource asset archiving remains available without detaching its existing references [90m(531.2006ms)[39m[39m
