[32m✔ sync never clears a mapped certification when the legacy resource has none [90m(5.0163ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ sync keeps a mapped asset when its project resource no longer has an image [90m(5.078ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ a deliberately deleted mapped asset is not recreated by later resource sync [90m(3.64ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ a deleted project-resource tombstone wins over a legacy duplicate and blocks storyboard relinking [90m(2.9286ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ explicit project-resource detach survives sync and can be explicitly restored [90m(5.6042ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ SD2 certificate creation reports a missing provider asset instead of dereferencing null [90m(0.9706ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ SD2 settlement is scheduled after the request-visible processing state is saved [90m(52.0311ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ SD2 processing certifications resume after a backend restart [90m(5.1217ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ a queued SD2 certification with a permanent submission error becomes failed instead of retrying forever [90m(2.42ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ asset update stores SD2 identity declaration as a SQLite integer and returns a boolean [90m(23.0349ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ asset update serializes metadata and tags before binding them to SQLite [90m(6.3247ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ asset checksum lookup deduplicates only within the same asset scope [90m(2.6503ms)[39m[39m
