[32m✔ asset lineage retains ancestors and derived versions, including soft-deleted entries [90m(3.4778ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ locally archived media never exposes a supplier signed URL [90m(1.6394ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ asset lookup by id uses the same personal/project scope as the library [90m(4.6595ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ project owner retains CRUD access when a legacy asset has a stale direct owner [90m(5.2809ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ new assets receive a stable type-prefixed reference alias while retaining the original file name [90m(1.6434ms)[39m[39m
