[32m✔ billing settles real provider usage above the authorization when the released balance covers it [90m(698.6146ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ usage summary keeps project attribution as an authorization-time snapshot and separates unassigned history [90m(607.7537ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ project snapshot backfill only restores an unambiguous owned generation [90m(508.2459ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ billing keeps the authorization frozen for reconciliation when actual usage exceeds releasable balance [90m(372.9366ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ an administrator can collect a historical capped-settlement difference exactly once [90m(408.3815ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ bulk historical settlement repair collects every eligible user and reports insufficient balances [90m(433.7617ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ setting a balance targets the requested amount instead of adding to it [90m(408.3741ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ admin grants are additive and idempotent while lifetime consumption remains independent [90m(393.3557ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ billing, usage, and audit logs expose stable server-side pagination [90m(321.3745ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ expired reconciliation releases the frozen authorization and leaves an audit trail [90m(250.4444ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ three pending reconciliations for one model rate-limit later calls [90m(254.9211ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ passwords have no format rule beyond being non-empty [90m(272.3167ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ self registration creates a normal user and an authenticated session [90m(260.7054ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ a user can change a unique username and receives a session for the new identity [90m(219.779ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ published price books require explicit, positive or free prices [90m(205.9156ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ conditional video token rates use integer points with no floating point drift [90m(346.0836ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ conditional video rates prefer the most specific matching rule and reject ambiguity [90m(411.0896ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ token price tiers use only canonical usage and reject uncovered ranges [90m(274.8917ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ micro-points preserve a non-zero charge for low token usage [90m(247.8962ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ billing precision migration is idempotent after the ledger is converted [90m(271.6558ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ creator model list never exposes provider credentials [90m(204.0384ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ custom provider billing keys isolate identical provider model names [90m(226.8561ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ drama listing is scoped by owner [90m(355.1346ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ omni sequences and tool runs stay scoped and settle their authorization [90m(341.4957ms)[39m[39m
