[32m✔ frame interpolation submit uses the official client_token field [90m(417.5432ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ frame interpolation persists provider identity, local output, exact settlement, and idempotent replay [90m(716.7853ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ completed-video output never falls back to a supplier signed URL [90m(2.1502ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ video list exposes a durable local poster path without mounting video bytes [90m(13.4147ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ homepage defaults use the configured product media resources rather than any user videos [90m(8.8707ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ a completed local video remains completed when OSS archival is temporarily unavailable [90m(7.197ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ startup reconciliation invalidates historical completed rows without a local archive [90m(1.5842ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ video post-processing defaults to preserving the generated source [90m(3.2636ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ 480p supports optional 720p or 1080p enhancement [90m(0.3062ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ 720p supports only an optional 1080p enhancement [90m(0.6751ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ 1080p cannot be redundantly enhanced and 2K is not an exposed target [90m(0.323ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ interpolation is independent from enhancement and may be disabled [90m(0.2828ms)[39m[39m
